                "text": "Hospitals exist to save lives, not impose medical mandates on vulnerable patients. @RepMichaelRulli and I introduced the COVID-19 Vaccination Non-Discrimination Act today to ensure no American is refused a transplant over personal medical decisions. \n\nhttps://t.co/qA64KnLE76",
