                "text": "Yesterday, @RepMichaelRulli and I sent a letter to President Trump asking him to issue an Executive Order to block hospitals from denying organ transplants for people not vaccinated against COVID-19.\n\nPatients \u2013 especially children \u2013 should never be turned away from care due to government-imposed mandates.",
