                "text": "Latest bills introduced will:\n\u2705 Prohibit federal funds for universities that hire illegal immigrants\n\u2705 Protect U.S. educational institutions from foreign financial influence\n\u2705 Improve access to care for patients with terminal illnesses\n\u2705 Provide a federal tax credit to families with foster children\n\nWe\u2019re standing up for students, families, and American values!",
