                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Federal benefits were meant for our most vulnerable Americans\u2014pregnant women, children, seniors, and individuals with disabilities. The One Big Beautiful Bill protects coverage for them and ends taxpayer-funded benefits for illegal immigrants, duplicate enrollees, and able-bodied adults who refuse to work.",
