                "retweet_count": 34,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Only 7% of Medicaid hospital spending reaches rural communities. That\u2019s unacceptable.\n\nThe One Big Beautiful Bill fixes it\u2014with a $50 billion investment that guarantees at least $100 million a year for every state to support rural hospitals, providers, and patients.\n\nThis isn\u2019t about more bureaucracy\u2014it\u2019s about real reinvestment where it\u2019s needed most.",
